If you have the means to control a teleport, and can do a teleport inside a 
level, there's one place the Lichs go to when they're low on HP.  Try to 
beat them there, so they can't keep escaping from you.

If your inventory is hosed, then maybe now would be a good time to levelport 
somewhere safe, fix everything, and then come back later.  Make sure they 
aren't adjacent when you invoke the orb, IIRC they are allowed to follow you 
if they're nearby. 




